Hey Tejas,

A 200 OK tells you the page loads. It doesn’t tell you the signup form works or
last night’s backup actually ran.

Better Stack covers both:


HEARTBEATS FOR SCHEDULED JOBS

Add one line to the end of your cron job or backup script. If we don’t hear from
it on time, we alert you.



Create a heartbeat →
[https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/25kEYDlC22YBL5tWgEGVffBzDFiZrMfd/click?signature=089ed2498954082a3f40b99832e1a7d9b8e4635b&url=https%3A%2F%2Fincidents.betterstack.com%2Fteam%2F0%2Fheartbeats%2Fnew%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_heartbeats_playwright]
2 minutes

Create a heartbeat
[https://betterstack.com/static/images/email/onboarding/heartbeats.png]
