TRANSACTION MONITORING FOR USER FLOWS

We run your Playwright script in a real Chrome browser: log in, add to cart,
check out. If a step fails, you get an incident, just like with uptime.



Create a Playwright monitor →
[https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/25kEYDlC22YBL5tWgEGVffBzDFiZrMfd/click?signature=9db353c8d12e2d9044eb192788df71db1cb993bd&url=https%3A%2F%2Fincidents.betterstack.com%2Fteam%2F0%2Fmonitors%2Fnew%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_heartbeats_playwright]
